  "prefLabel": "Puc 2002.10 Utility",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 2002.10 “Utility” means any electric generation, transmission, or distribution company meeting the definition of a public utility under RSA 362:2 and RSA 362:4-a, and includes rural electric cooperatives.\n\nSource. #12372, eff 11-1-17 (from Puc 2002.09); ss by #14576, eff 5-13-26, EXPIRES: 5-13-36 (formerly Puc 2002.24)",
